80 bits per u-monomial (`scripts/sjsu/ledger/fobs.py`): the rounded, pruned literal IS the
observable. `Ftab j` lists `(s, F_{j,s})`; `f_j(u, φ) = Σ_s u^s (F_{j,s}.opd w S).eval S φ`.
-/

